  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Welcome to 30A Happy by the Sea, professionally managed by Bonheur Vacations, where coastal elegance meets relaxed comfort along Scenic Highway 30A. Ideally located between the charming communities of Blue Mountain Beach and Dune Allen, this beautifully designed retreat offers the perfect setting for unforgettable beach vacations with family and friends.<br><br>Step inside to an inviting open-concept living space highlighted by soaring ceilings, abundant natural light, and thoughtfully curated coastal décor. The spacious living, dining, and kitchen areas flow seamlessly, creating an ideal environment for gathering, entertaining, and unwinding after a day at the beach.<br><br>The chef’s kitchen is fully equipped with high-end appliances, generous counter space, and everything needed to prepare everything from gourmet meals to poolside snacks. Just outside, your private backyard oasis awaits—featuring a heated pool and spa, lounge seating, outdoor dining, TV, and grill, all surrounded by lush landscaping for added privacy.<br><br>Designed to comfortably accommodate up to 14 guests, the home features six bedrooms, four and a half bathrooms, and an additional office space—offering plenty of room for multi-family vacations, group retreats, or extended stays. Each bedroom is thoughtfully appointed to ensure rest and relaxation for every guest.<br><br>For adventure seekers, nearby access to the Choctawhatchee Bay and the Gulf of Mexico provides excellent opportunities for boating, fishing, paddleboarding, and more. Whether you’re planning action-packed days or peaceful evenings by the pool, 30A Happy by the Sea delivers the ultimate coastal escape.<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>Private backyard entertainment area with TV, dining table & lounge seating<br><br>Private Heated Pool & Spa (heating available upon request)<br><br>Golf Cart<br><br>Boat Friendly<br><br>Outdoor grill<br><br>4 bicycles<br><br>Large chef’s kitchen<br><br>Smart TVs throughout the home<br><br>Full-size washer & dryer<br><br>Fully stocked kitchen<br><br>Full linen package (bedding & bath)<br><br>Starter kit provided (toilet paper, paper towels, dishwasher & laundry pods)<br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS<br><br>Bedroom 1: King Ensuite (Shower)<br><br>Bedroom 2: Queen Bedroom<br><br>Bedroom 3: King Ensuite (Shower)<br><br>Bedroom 4: King Ensuite (Shower)<br><br>Bedroom 5: Bunk Room (Double/Double)<br><br>Bedroom 6: King Ensuite (Shower)<br><br>Office Space<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA<br><br>Blue Mountain Beach is one of 30A’s most beloved coastal communities, known for its laid-back atmosphere, family-friendly feel, and beautiful natural surroundings. Located between Gulf Place and Grayton Beach, the area offers convenient access to local restaurants, boutiques, bike paths, and outdoor activities while maintaining a peaceful, uncrowded vibe.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS<br><br>Gulfview Heights Beach Access is the closest public access point, located approximately 3 blocks from the home. Amenities include parking, restrooms, outdoor showers, picnic tables with covered seating, and seasonal lifeguards.<br><br>Directions:<br>From the home, turn right on 30A, then left at Goatfeathers Seafood onto Gulfview Heights Street. Continue approximately ¼ mile to the beach access.<br><br>LOCAL ATTRACTIONS<br><br>The Big Chill 30A<br><br>Gulf Place Plaza<br><br>Grayton Beach State Park<br><br>Camp Helen State Park<br><br>Alys Beach<br><br>Seaside<br><br>WaterColor<br><br>Village of Baytowne Wharf<br><br>Henderson Beach State Park<br><br>No pets permitted.<br><br>Maximum parking: 3 vehicles.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "30A Happy by the Sea | Private Heated Pool & Spa, Golf Cart, Near Beach"
        }
      ],
